"-Yc``\\ , ``Y = -Xc``\\ , ``Z = -Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:326
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 90° CW from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = "
"-Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chippet nedåtvänt, roterat 90° medurs från :data:`AXIS_P4`\\ . Utdataxlar: "
"``X = -Xc``\\ , ``Y = +Yc``\\ , ``Z = -Zc``\\ ."
